<title>AUSTRIA: Iran sees OPEC output rollover minimum six months.</title>
<headline>Iran sees OPEC output rollover minimum six months.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iranian oil minister Gholamreza Aghazadeh said that OPEC was likely to rollover its output ceiling for a &quot;minimum of six months.&quot;</p>
<p>He was speaking to reporters as he left to attend the group's second session scheduled to begin at 0900 gmt.</p>
<p>He said that session would be the last of the meeting.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
